				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				143
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be set up, erected</i>, or <i>built</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη, ἥ τ᾽ ἐπὶ τύμβῳ ἑστήκῃ</span>”
