				A.
				111.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in marking
			Time, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρος νέον ἱσταμένοιο</span>
