				1.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχεδὸν ἤδη μεσημβρία ἵσταται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					242a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>to be appointed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆναι ἐς ἀρχήν</span>”
